中文:
引理 Submonoid.closure_irreducible
  条件: [Monoid.FG M]
  证明: by
  classical
  -- Pick a minimal set `S` generating `M`.
  obtain ⟨S, hSgen, hSmax⟩ := Submonoid.exists_minimal_closure_eq_top M
  -- We claim that `S` is the set of irreducible elements of `M`.
